### Create project
mvn io.quarkus.platform:quarkus-maven-plugin:3.15.1:create -DprojectGroupId=org.acme -DprojectArtifactId=quarkus-in-action -Dextensions="quarkus-rest"

### Pre Step: Install wrapper
mvn wrapper:wrapper

### Start Quarkus application in Dev Mode
./mvnw quarkus:dev

### Build
./mvnw package

### Build with Quarkus CLI
quarkus build

### Run compiled application
java -jar target/quarkus-app/quarkus-run.jar

### Build native-image
./mvnw package -Pnative
./target/quarkus-in-action-1.0.0-SNAPSHOT-runner

### Build with Docker or Podman
./mvnw package -Pnative -Dquarkus.native.container-build=true
